Subject: [PATCH 10/24] fix(payment): dynamically use real cart total for
 Paymob intention

- Pass actual CartSummary total to PaymentRepositoryImpl and Paymob Intention API

- Convert BigDecimal to cents for Paymob API amount format

- Include user's specific Integration ID in the payment_methods array
